1
00:00:01,269 --> 00:00:02,307
Lee Hyeon-wu!

2
00:00:40,531 --> 00:00:41,531
Hyeon-wu

3
00:00:42,308 --> 00:00:43,902
Is your leg okay?

4
00:00:45,070 --> 00:00:46,271
How long
have you been here?

5
00:00:46,862 --> 00:00:48,332
Since school let out

6
00:00:58,328 --> 00:00:59,402
I'm really sorry

7
00:01:01,119 --> 00:01:02,226
It's all my fault

8
00:01:03,438 --> 00:01:05,062
Maybe it wasn't
like that at first

9
00:01:06,608 --> 00:01:08,777
but I wanted
to be friends with you

10
00:01:09,256 --> 00:01:10,256
Hong Il-tak

11
00:01:12,056 --> 00:01:13,516
Even after what I did

12
00:01:14,681 --> 00:01:16,118
you still
want to be friends?

13
00:01:16,650 --> 00:01:17,650
Yeah

14
00:01:18,927 --> 00:01:20,147
I still
want to be friends

15
00:01:22,206 --> 00:01:24,112
I might keep making you
uncomfortable

16
00:01:27,049 --> 00:01:28,169
Are you still okay
with that?

17
00:01:30,836 --> 00:01:31,836
Yeah

18
00:01:33,074 --> 00:01:34,074
I don't mind

19
00:01:47,756 --> 00:01:48,777
Whatever
the reason was

20
00:01:49,358 --> 00:01:50,358
Lee Hyeon-wu is now

21
00:01:50,902 --> 00:01:52,160
my only friend

22
00:01:54,667 --> 00:01:55,796
What's yours, Il-tak?

23
00:01:56,625 --> 00:01:58,170
Mine is the "Worry Doll"

24
00:01:58,253 --> 00:01:59,870
Sometimes…

25
00:01:59,953 --> 00:02:02,525
it can feel
a bit embarrassing

26
00:02:02,608 --> 00:02:03,518
Show it to me

27
00:02:03,601 --> 00:02:04,958
Don't cover it
with your hand

28
00:02:07,704 --> 00:02:08,704
Huh?
